42
00:02:01,412 --> 00:02:04,581
Good idea.
Attention is what birds want.

43
00:02:05,958 --> 00:02:07,000
Oh.

44
00:02:07,168 --> 00:02:09,128
Much better. All right.

45
00:02:09,295 --> 00:02:11,422
