53
00:03:10,398 --> 00:03:13,818
Please, that's a seagull.
If you're not going to help, don't help.

54
00:03:14,318 --> 00:03:16,653
Sorry. Hey, do you think
I'm over-dressed?

55
00:03:16,821 --> 00:03:20,533
Uh, it depends on the activity.
For a prostate exam, yes.

56
00:03:22,368 --> 00:03:25,204
If you're playing Vegas,
I'd add sequins.

57
00:03:25,746 --> 00:03:27,414
I'm going to the movies with Penny.

58
00:03:27,581 --> 00:03:29,416
