61
00:03:33,713 --> 00:03:36,006
Or you think she thinks
you think it's a date.

62
00:03:36,173 --> 00:03:39,092
-Are we over-thinking this?
-Not at all.

63
00:03:39,969 --> 00:03:44,469
-You're right. I'm fine. I'm wearing this.
-Really? A blazer? All right.

64
00:03:50,896 --> 00:03:53,648
Yes, hello.
Uh, this is Dr. Sheldon Cooper.

65
00:03:53,816 --> 00:03:56,693
I'm at 2311
North Los Robles Avenue.

66
00:03:56,861 --> 00:03:59,572
