calls me fat ass.

140
00:08:25,587 --> 00:08:26,879
Need I go on?

141
00:08:27,047 --> 00:08:29,883
Yes, please.
This is way better than the movie, heh.

142
00:08:30,050 --> 00:08:33,011
All right, Sheldon.
Your bird death ray is ready.

143
00:08:33,178 --> 00:08:37,473
It's not a death ray. It's just a little
